# One person, five git identities. Without this, GitHub's contributor graph and
# `git shortlog` show four or five humans where there is one, and any
# bibliometric tool counting contributors gets it wrong.
#
# The canonical identity is the institutional one, since that is what CITATION.cff
# and the ORCID record carry.
